Use case: identity-preserve. Asset type: transparent 2D game cinematic sprite sheet, 8 poses.
Input image 1 is the exact rough etched trading-card style and face reference; images 2 and 3 show the SAME intact character's costume and full-body proportions.
Create eight NEW full-body poses of this SAME fictional parody character Homelesslander: tall gaunt furious blond male superhero with angular unshaven face, huge tired bright blue eyes, messy swept blond hair, shredded dark navy blue suit, ornate battered golden eagle shoulder armor, gold belt, red long gloves, red boots, ragged red cape. He clutches or wears a battered plain brown cardboard box; no letters.
Layout: precise 4 columns by 2 rows, transparent background, each pose wholly contained inside its own equal cell, substantial empty transparent gutters between cells, consistent character proportions and scale. Exactly ONE complete intact actor per cell. All head, feet, fingers and cape tips inside each cell. No labels, no gridlines, no background, no ground shadow, no smoke or energy or detached fragments.
