1 standing, shoulders hunched, both hands gripping intact cardboard box at waist, furious narrowed eyes;
2 low crouch over box, cape tucked behind, glaring forward;
3 charging power stance, knees bent, grips box to torso, straining face;
4 takes flight toward right with body diagonal and box gripped to chest, intact cape trails left;
5 fully extended superhero flying toward right, box clamped under one arm, worried angry face;
